174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 147 0 R
/E (The Catalogue of Green Practices in front of you has been developed as a practical guide to help you adopt more environmentally responsible lifestyles while in Belgrade, Serbia, home to the University of Belgrade - Faculty of Organizational Sciences \(FON\). The Catalogue brings together simple, practical, and informed ideas that can be applied in your everyday life, whether while you are in Belgrade or at FON studying. The Catalogue covers awareness and motivation, habits - such as living and accommodation, buying and consumption, digital habits, and community engagement.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
