207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (FON is also currently developing its first Sustainability Report, the first report of its kind at the University of Belgrade and one of the first faculty-level sustainability reports in Serbia. This initiative provides an important foundation for presenting green practices not only as individual tips and activities, but also as part of a broader system for monitoring sustainability performance, setting measurable goals, and strengthening institutional responsibility. By collecting and reporting relevant data, FON aims to better understand its environmental and social impacts, track progress over time, and support more informed and transparent sustainability decisions across the faculty community.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
