216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Everyday habits shape a large part of our environmental impact. While studying at FON, your habits are closely connected to the rhythm of life in Belgrade, a busy, diverse city where commuting, studying, food, shopping, digital devices, and managing accommodation all involve daily choices. Some students live close to the faculty, while others travel from different parts of the city or surrounding municipalities, so the most sustainable option will not always look the same for everyone.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (By choosing lower-impact transport, saving energy and water, reducing waste, consuming more thoughtfully, and using technology responsibly, you can gradually build habits that are better for both the environment and your own quality of life.)
/Pg 14 0 R
