256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (Where and how you live can strongly influence your use of energy, water, and other resources. In Belgrade, as a student, you may stay in university dormitories, rented apartments, shared flats, or family homes, and you do not always have full control over heating systems, cooling, appliances, or waste infrastructure. Some accommodation costs may be included in the rent, while others are paid separately, which can also affect how visible everyday resource use feels. For this reason, sustainable living is not about expecting everyone to have the same options, but about making responsible choices wherever possible.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
