/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (A sustainable student room does not need to be perfect or expensive. It can begin with a few realistic routines: switching off lights when leaving, airing rooms briefly rather than keeping windows open for long periods during heating season, using reusable household items, avoiding unnecessary purchases, and communicating with roommates about shared energy, water, and waste habits. In a large city like Belgrade, these small actions can become especially meaningful when thousands of students practice them together.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
