279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 153 0 R
/E (FON is working towards introducing greener classroom practices that make sustainability part of everyday teaching and studying. These include switching off lights, projectors, computers, and air-conditioning when rooms are not in use; reducing unnecessary printing; using digital learning materials; separating waste; and encouraging students to bring reusable bottles and mugs. One simple digital option is to use Ecosia as a search engine: the company directs all its profits towards climate action, with most of the funding supporting tree-planting projects. By combining small classroom routines with wider initiatives such as green classrooms, responsible digital use, and student awareness campaigns, FON strives to make sustainability more visible, practical, and easy to practice)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
