/P 156 0 R
/T (Belgrade also has numerous tailors and alteration shops where clothing can be shortened, resized, repaired, or redesigned, helping favourite garments stay in use for longer. Formal dresses, suits, costumes, and special-occasion clothing can also be rented from local fashion studios and rental services such as Rent a Porter instead of being purchased for a single event. Swapping clothes with friends, donating items, buying from local designers, choosing durable pieces, and repairing before replacing are all practical ways to make fashion in Belgrade more circular, creative, and budget-friendly.)
