/E (Sustainability is not only about personal habits -it is also about caring for people and places around us. In Belgrade, you can take part in humanitarian campaigns, volunteering activities, donation drives, environmental clean-ups, support for vulnerable groups, and community events. Opportunities are available through organisations such as the Red Cross, ADRA Serbia, humanitarian foundations, local associations, student organisations, and neighbourhood initiatives. If you want to join a volunteer group, you can check out these websites as well - Smart Kolektiv and Volonteri na mrezi by UNICEF. You can contribute by volunteering your time, collecting food, clothes, school supplies, hygiene products, or bottle caps, helping organise fundraising events, sharing verified appeals, or offering your)
